# Project Architecture (FSD)

Layer order (higher may import lower; never reverse):

`app → pages → widgets → features → entities → shared`

## Placement

- `app/` — providers, router, theme, global CSS
- `pages/` — route composition only
- `widgets/` — composite UI (sidebar, editor layout)
- `features/` — user actions (auth, create, rename, edit, share, import)
- `entities/` — domain types, `*Api.ts`, domain UI (e.g. DocumentCard)
- `shared/` — Supabase client, UI primitives, lib utilities

## Rules

- No circular dependencies; no cross-feature imports
- Encapsulate Supabase I/O in `entities/**/model/*Api.ts`
- Reuse existing shared components and entity APIs before adding new ones
- Inspect relevant files before architectural changes; do not restructure wholesale
- Prefer small, reviewable diffs scoped to the requested task

## Accepted exception

`shared/ui/ThemeToggle` imports `useTheme` from `app/theme`. Do not "fix" this by forcing a large restructure unless asked.
